# Midterm - ls(1)

## Description

This project implements the ls(1) command according to the
provided NetBSD ls(1) manual.

## Supported options

-A
-a
-c
-d
-F
-f
-h
-i
-k
-l
-n
-q
-R
-r
-S
-s
-t
-u
-w

## Build

make

## Examples

./ls
./ls -a
./ls -A
./ls -l
./ls -la
./ls -i
./ls -F
./ls -R
./ls -r
./ls -S
./ls -t
./ls -n
./ls -h

## Grep Scenario

A security log was created and grep was used to filter
ERROR, WARNING, and permission-related events.

## Files

ls.c       Main ls implementation
ls.h       Data structures and declarations
print.c    Output and long-format functions
print.h    Output declarations
Makefile   Build configuration
README     Project documentation
checklist  Assignment checklist
